    "detailed_description": "<strong>Screenwrite differently!</strong><br><br>You don't have to be locked with a unique software for screenwriting.<br><br>What if you could write everywhere, on any devices (computer, ipad, phones...), on any app (Google Doc, Dropbox Paper, Word, Miro, Evernotes, Trello, ...)<br>What if you could stop caring about formatting, upper cases, and almost everything actually?<br><br><br>Product features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Write pure plain text, quick and easy.<br></li><li>Write on any device, any word processor editor.<br></li><li>Generate professionnal paginated PDF.<br></li><li>Send screenplay directly in FinalDraft.<br></li><li>Live preview.<br></li><li>PDF export automatically fixes uppercases, punctuations, spaces,...<br></li><li>Outline structure panel.<br></li><li>Scene numbering.<br></li><li>Companion app available on Android and iOs.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Screenwrite differently!</strong><br><br>You don't have to be locked with a unique software for screenwriting.<br><br>What if you could write everywhere, on any devices (computer, ipad, phones...), on any app (Google Doc, Dropbox Paper, Word, Miro, Evernotes, Trello, ...)<br>What if you could stop caring about formatting, upper cases, and almost everything actually?<br><br><br>Product features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Write pure plain text, quick and easy.<br></li><li>Write on any device, any word processor editor.<br></li><li>Generate professionnal paginated PDF.<br></li><li>Send screenplay directly in FinalDraft.<br></li><li>Live preview.<br></li><li>PDF export automatically fixes uppercases, punctuations, spaces,...<br></li><li>Outline structure panel.<br></li><li>Scene numbering.<br></li><li>Companion app available on Android and iOs.</li></ul>",
